\pard\keep\keepn\sb160\sa120\sl240\slmult1\qj\b Project 50  Open Source Issue Triage and Developer Assignment Tool\par

\pard\sa60\sl240\slmult1\qj Duration: \b0 8 weeks  |  \b Implementation: \b0 C or C++  |  \b Mode: \b0 Student product with individual algorithm ownership\par

\pard\keep\keepn\sb160\sa120\sl240\slmult1\qj\b Project Explanation in Ten Lines\par

\pard\fi-259\li259\sa30\sl240\slmult1\qj 1. \b0 Build an industry-style software engineering system representing issues, labels, code modules, developers and dependency links through typed records, arrays, trees and weighted or capacitated graphs.\par
\b 2. \b0 The core objective is to match issues to developers and prioritize dependency-aware release work, subject to explicit constraints, validation rules and measurable service indicators.\par
\b 3. \b0 Organize and retrieve workloads with student implementations of merge sort, quick sort, iterative and recursive binary search, and domain-specific indices.\par
\b 4. \b0 Create divide-and-conquer modules for maximum subarrays, fast powering, celebrity discovery, and classical versus Strassen matrix multiplication.\par
\b 5. \b0 Map activity selection, interval partitioning, Huffman coding, Dijkstra, Prim and Kruskal to scheduling, compression, routing and infrastructure decisions.\par
\b 6. \b0 Build dynamic-programming alternatives using 0/1 knapsack, matrix chains, LCS, optimal BST, Bellman-Ford, Floyd-Warshall and bounded TSP instances.\par
\b 7. \b0 Use N-Queens and subset problems to validate backtracking, then compare FIFO, LIFO and least-cost branch-and-bound for an exact project decision.\par
\b 8. \b0 Model capacity allocation with Ford-Fulkerson and implement maximum bipartite matching for a meaningful two-sided assignment.\par
\b 9. \b0 Add a Chinese Remainder Theorem utility and benchmark naive, Rabin-Karp, finite-automaton and KMP matching on domain text or event sequences.\par
\b 10. \b0 Report recurrence solutions, asymptotic and empirical results, correctness evidence, complexity-class analysis, a reduction mapping and the recommended production strategy.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\sb160\sa120\sl240\slmult1\qj\b Expected Product\par

\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa60\sl240\slmult1\qj\tx360\b0 A portable C/C++ application delivering a repository triage prototype with text search and assignment plans.\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}A reusable library containing every mandatory syllabus implementation behind consistent interfaces.\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}A menu-driven CLI or optional desktop interface for loading data, selecting algorithms, running scenarios and exporting CSV or JSON.\par
